libdatachannel v0.24.5: retain a closing libjuice agent outside ICE teardown

NereusSDR for iOS patch, applied after 0002 by ios/scripts/vendor-sources.sh.
MPL-2.0, like the covered file it changes. Task 56, 2026-09-27.

The ICE transport begins bounded libjuice close, transfers its unique agent
to one ThreadPool-scheduled retirement owner, and keeps an Init token until
final destruction. No retry wait occupies the shared transport teardown task
or libjuice poll thread.

